---
description: Data access, validation, and data-handling rules
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

## Data Access Rules
- UI (screens and components) MUST NOT use fetch, axios, or database APIs directly.
- Data access must be performed via services exposed through hooks.
- Services may access repositories; repositories may access the database.
- Services and repositories must be instantiated ONLY in `src/container.ts`.

## Validation
- Use Zod for all user-input validation.
- Validate inputs before invoking service methods.

## Storage
- Sensitive data MUST be stored using `expo-secure-store`.
- Application data MUST be stored in local SQLite only.

## Logging
- Do NOT use `console.log`.
- Use the centralized logger from `@/src/utils/logger`.
